  "20261106142500|Attention : 1ox~" +
  "20261106142700|1PMX UT Support @ S1 D, Daily VWAP, 5E100\nAttention : 1M2X UT~" +
  "20261106143600|Price has retraced down to and taken support of 1E21..~" +
  "20261106143900|Attention : 5m Stochastic cross up from MZ..~" +
  "20261106144200|Price has retraced down to and taken support of 1E21..~" +
  "20261106144500|Attention : 1M2X DT~" +
  "20261106144800|1PMX DT Resistance @ R2 D\nAttention : 1PX DT~" +
  "20261106144900|Attention : 1PX UT~" +
  "20261106145000|Attention : 1ox~" +
  "20261106145200|1PMX UT Support @ S1 D, Daily VWAP, 5E100\nAttention : 1M2X UT~" +
  "20261106145800|Price has retraced down to and taken support of 1E21..~" +
  "20261106150000|Attention : 1M2X DT~" +
